=== technical_detail ===
For the layout, I guided the level design team by grayboxing blockouts that deliberately introduced and tested each gun’s specific color abilities before ramping up the difficulty. 

For the art design, our goal was to create an incredibly colorful experience. 

I pitched combining a dynamic Splatoon-style paint mechanic with a cute, cardboard-textured world aesthetic to give the environment a charming personality.

And we made the characters cats because cats = cute!
-> END